  "statement": "# Hive Flight — task brief\n\nThis is a design target, not an implementation specification. Build your own GDD, scene structure, rules, and code.\n\n## Target player experience\n\nRun through a side-scrolling forest route, read obstacles quickly, recover from small mistakes, and stay ahead of a pursuing swarm.\n\n## Scope boundary\n\nA short 2D runner-platformer with escalating chase pressure, hazards, recoverable and terminal failures, and final escape.\n\n## Creative freedom\n\nYou may choose track beats, obstacle combinations, chase tuning, collectibles, and forest composition.\n"
